    /// Enabled capabilities for this association. key -&gt; (string) AWS DevOps Agent capability types representing the set of auto- mated capabilities that can be enabled per association. Possible values: o RELEASE_READINESS_REVIEW o RELEASE_READINESS_REVIEW_AUTOMATED_TESTING value -&gt; (structure) Capability configuration for the AWS DevOps Agent. enabled -&gt; (boolean) Whether the capability is enabled. triggerFilterGroups -&gt; (list) Optional trigger filter groups. Evaluated only when en- abled=true; retained while the capability is disabled, so re-enabling restores the prior trigger behavior. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 5 (structure) A group of trigger conditions. The group matches when ALL present conditions pass. A group cannot be empty: at least one condition must be present. events -&gt; (list) Passes when the webhook event is one of the listed events. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 10 (string) Webhook events that can auto-trigger a capability. PULL_REQUEST_* events apply to RELEASE_READI- NESS_REVIEW; WORKFLOW_* events apply to RE- LEASE_SHEPHERDING. Possible values: o PULL_REQUEST_READY_FOR_REVIEW o PULL_REQUEST_DRAFT targetBranches -&gt; (structure) Passes when the change request target branch matches. Applicable to RELEASE_READINESS_REVIEW only. patterns -&gt; (list) [required] Anchored full-match regex patterns. The condition passes when the value matches at least one pat- tern. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 20 (string) A regex pattern matched against the entire value. Example: 'main' or 'release/.*'. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 256 o pattern: [^\x00-\x1F\x7F-\x9F]+ JSON Syntax: {"RELEASE_READINESS_REVIEW"|"RELEASE_READINESS_REVIEW_AUTOMATED_TESTING": { "enabled": true|false, "triggerFilterGroups": [ { "events": ["PULL_REQUEST_READY_FOR_REVIEW"|"PULL_REQUEST_DRAFT", ...], "targetBranches": { "patterns": ["string", ...] } } ... ] } ...}
